{"id":"lefty.1","lang":"en","desc":"A programmable graphics editor for technical pictures. Note: This command is deprecated.","items":[["Open a Lefty program file","lefty {{path/to/file.lefty}}"],["Read a program from `stdin`","lefty -"],["Execute an [e]xpression","lefty -e '{{expression}}'"],["E[x]it after processing the input file","lefty -x {{path/to/file.lefty}}"],["Set the [e]rror reporting [l]evel (`0` through `5`)","lefty -el {{level}} {{path/to/file.lefty}}"],["Display help","lefty -?"],["Display version","lefty -V"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/common/lefty.md"}